-- title:
--   Original BV C1 compact-band localisation gives the exact compensated H real stopped jump series
-- statement:
--   For the actual original bounded-variation Lévy path, original admissible dividend strategy, and compact interior C1 band with the original ruin/horizon clock, the full original compensated H marked-jump real integral equals the original stopped signed nonlinear jump-time series almost surely. The source-specific proof extracts the Lipschitz and value bounds from the accepted original BV compact C1 localisation and instantiates the independently proved unconditional H real series equality, preserving the original jump sample path, origin exclusion and final contact.

